        "title": "The graph below shows the number of overseas visitors to three different areas in a European country between 1987 and 2007. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting this main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G9gudMtOjoLuFJxIQ1kluGcQgZd\"><em><strong>The graph below shows the number of overseas visitors to three different areas in a European country between 1987 and 2007. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting this main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Overseas Visitors to Three Areas (1987&ndash;2007)</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yt4odmIGNoPQTlxBmpRl46shgZk\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2axdDnHHoyIGkxny9wlOodIgEg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Overseas Visitors to Three Areas (1987&ndash;2007) y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả&nbsp;<strong>lượng kh&aacute;ch du lịch quốc tế đến 3 khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau từ 1987 đến 2007.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CSJgdV6lSoMCCdxfRULljHPcg3c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QSdPdXBO8ongd4xxQJYlPqr7gUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Overseas Visitors to Three Areas (1987&ndash;2007) với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;:&nbsp;<strong>lượng kh&aacute;ch du lịch quốc tế - 3 khu vực: the Coast, Mountains v&agrave; Lakes - 1987 đến 2007</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NUeJdktn0ogNfGxAjkKlkOrJgOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: rgb(79, 84, 100);\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VRzSdk307oBSSZx2JaclJJ77gCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>lượng kh&aacute;ch du lịch đến 3 khu vực c&oacute; xu hướng tăng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OjZUdNl3zoMgESxKAYZliYB1ghf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Lake c&oacute; biến đổi nhiều nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IBPVdlHq5oiOaBx2zBSlZP8SgSd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OECJdECsFoTtJcxKz6DlJ1s5gOc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Lake</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IBPVdlHq5oiOaBx2zBSlZP8SgSd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IdAidFTHEoihHax0C3blMJRFgjd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1987 </strong><em>(ở mức thấp nhất l&agrave; 10,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3irdmX7JodQMRxBYVEl8kppgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Lake </strong>(<em><strong>tăng chậm</strong></em><em> tới 20,000 v&agrave;o 1992, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> tới 40,000 v&agrave;o 1997, </em><em><strong>chạm mức cao nhất</strong></em><em> l&agrave; 75,000 v&agrave;o 2002 nhưng </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> c&ograve;n 50,000 v&agrave;o 2007)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BTxLdmMmboqhX5xM7LQl51qVgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BTxLdmMmboqhX5xM7LQl51qVgye\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Coast v&agrave; Mountains</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BTxLdmMmboqhX5xM7LQl51qVgye\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hf1tdGKwwoMtPHxLIWzln6TIgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1987 </strong><em>(Coast cao nhất l&agrave; 40,000, gấp đ&ocirc;i Mountains l&agrave; 20,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JI4cduNOzoPXVZxRvhBlCT2Igaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Coast </strong>(<em><strong>gỉam nhẹ </strong></em><em>c&ograve;n 35,000 v&agrave;o 1992, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> tới 45,000 v&agrave;o 1997 v&agrave; ở mức 70,000 v&agrave;o 2007)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaJhdjwcpoIF9OxHdHQlNfqDgNb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Mountains </strong>(<em><strong>ổn định</strong></em><strong> </strong><em>tới 1992, sau đ&oacute; </em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> tới 30,000 v&agrave;o 1997 v&agrave; </em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> tới 35,000 v&agrave;o 2007)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0c3dGZoNomf7CxYvAslCF1Ugaf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U9L2dNWsSoLUVvxZh8nl7OyCgPg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo&agrave;i từ <strong>\"visitors\"</strong> để chỉ kh&aacute;ch tham quan, đối với những địa điểm du lịch thi&ecirc;n nhi&ecirc;n trong b&agrave;i, m&igrave;nh cũng c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng từ <strong>\"sightseers\" </strong>để chỉ kh&aacute;ch tham quan, ngắm cảnh nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqtidLqLcozNsMxWZV9lwb3KgJl\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ocxidtv6noV3SOxaHYolEhrng5D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Looking at the Lakes region first, it started with the lowest figure of around 10,000 <strong>sightseers</strong> in 1987.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
