            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VBeBdZNqQo0wrexvWsCl5wjwg0d\">The line graph illustrates the number of overseas tourists visiting three different areas, namely the Coast, Mountains and Lakes regions over a 20-year period from 1987 to 2007.</div>\n</div>",
